<p>I agree that more &quot;mystery&quot; needs to be added to this SCP. My original intention was to have one experiment possible reference was to be made somewhere in the document about Nazi experiments of infusing technology with human brains, in this case the brain of a french orphan child but in the end I thought that too cliche.</p>

